{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":23.549999237060547,"text":"Cloth made on a loom with patterns repeating in a strict order. Diamonds, trees, birds, zigzags. Every region of Crete had its own motifs and a specialist can look at a piece and say which village it comes from, the way you would recognize a dialect. The patterns were not written down anywhere. They lived in memory and in hands and passed from one generation to the next by working beside somebody.","words":[{"word":"Cloth","start":0,"end":0.7200000286102295},{"word":"made","start":0.7200000286102295,"end":1.0399999618530273},{"word":"on","start":1.0399999618530273,"end":1.2200000286102295},{"word":"a","start":1.2200000286102295,"end":1.6200000047683716},{"word":"loom","start":1.6200000047683716,"end":1.6200000047683716},{"word":"with","start":1.6200000047683716,"end":2.0199999809265137},{"word":"patterns","start":2.0199999809265137,"end":2.359999895095825},{"word":"repeating","start":2.359999895095825,"end":2.799999952316284},{"word":"in","start":2.799999952316284,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"a","start":3.059999942779541,"end":3.359999895095825},{"word":"strict","start":3.359999895095825,"end":3.5399999618530273},{"word":"order","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":3.880000114440918},{"word":"Diamonds","start":4.920000076293945,"end":4.920000076293945},{"word":"trees","start":5.619999885559082,"end":5.619999885559082},{"word":"birds","start":6.179999828338623,"end":6.179999828338623},{"word":"zigzags","start":6.659999847412109,"end":7.039999961853027},{"word":"Every","start":7.639999866485596,"end":7.980000019073486},{"word":"region","start":7.980000019073486,"end":8.279999732971191},{"word":"of","start":8.279999732971191,"end":8.680000305175781},{"word":"Crete","start":8.680000305175781,"end":8.680000305175781},{"word":"had","start":8.680000305175781,"end":8.899999618530273},{"word":"its","start":8.899999618530273,"end":9.119999885559082},{"word":"own","start":9.119999885559082,"end":9